# Preserve archived E1 architecture prompt artifacts byte-for-byte.
# Their SHA-256 identities are cited in the handoff dossier, so git must not
# normalize their line endings on checkout or the identity claims break.
docs/internal/e1_arch_prompts/** -text
docs/internal/E1_ARCHITECTURE_COORDINATOR_HANDOFF.md -text

# The dossier is archived verbatim rather than edited (handoff index; the
# document's own provenance statement would become false about an edited copy).
# Its Markdown hard line breaks are trailing whitespace by design, and it ends
# with a blank line, so `git diff --check` must not police it. Without this the
# artifact-reproducibility whitespace stage fails on any commit that introduces
# or re-touches those lines. Reformatting the dossier is not the fix; it is
# evidence, not maintained prose.
docs/internal/E1_ARCHITECTURE_COORDINATOR_HANDOFF.md -whitespace
